
title Replace with the diagram title (what, scope, as-of date)

' Shape vocabulary (STYLE.md rule 2):
'   rectangle "Step" as s          process, task or step (rounded)
'   database "Store" as d          data store (cylinder); inside the stage package that writes it
'   cloud "Service" as c           external system, API or cloud service
'   hexagon "Check?" as k          check or decision (no diamond in component diagrams)
'   file "Report" as r             document, report or ticket
'   package "Group" <<group1>> { } repo, stage, schema or lane (container with a title)
' Colour = a <<stereotype>> defined once in <style> above; never #colour on an element.
' Failure point = the element where it happens, filled <<failure>> (STYLE.md rule 10).
' Detail in nested packages = inside the body: rectangle s [ Step\n..\n//detail line// ] (reference § Layout moves).
' Thin source: s ..> d   (dashed) plus ONE legend row "dashed line | inferred / not stated".

' Worked legend: keep only the rows this diagram uses (rule 9: every colour is listed).
legend right
  |= Mark |= Meaning |
  | rounded box | step |
  | cylinder | data store |
  | cloud | external service |
  | hexagon | check |
  |<#E3F2FD>| group1: name its meaning |
  |<#FADBD8>| failure point |
  | dashed line | inferred / not stated in the source |
endlegend
@enduml
